&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: left"&gt;小糸九州&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;Times New Roman&amp;apos;"&gt;㈱&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
